  { title: 'Cloudflare pays you.', text: `"Cloudflare acts as the Merchant of Record for pay per crawl" (${a(C.whatIs, 'What is Pay Per Crawl')}): it is the party that takes the crawler's payment. It pays monthly to a dedicated Stripe Connect account, "subject to settlement periods and minimum payout thresholds" (${a(C.payouts, 'Manage payouts')}).` },
];

