  { title: 'It enforces where FORA can\'t.', text: `"More than 20% of the web sits behind Cloudflare's network" (${a(C.smarter, 'Making AI search smarter')}, published 2026-07-01; vendor's own figure). A crawler you set to Charge with no billing relationship gets "the functional equivalent of a network level block" (${a(C.launch, 'launch post')}, published 2025-07-01). In July 2026, Cloudflare announced that on 2026-09-15 it would change the settings of every free customer that hadn't changed them (${a(C.press, 'press release')}). FORA's edge function refuses unlicensed AI bots only on the sites that install it.` },
